{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":260701,"duration_api_ms":325178,"num_turns":29,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5d45e206-6c41-4250-8c3a-d0f64b366d9c","total_cost_usd":1.8742735499999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":24,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59765,"cache_read_input_tokens":1420396,"output_tokens":7419,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59765,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":4764,"outputTokens":10405,"cacheReadInputTokens":1132333,"cacheCreationInputTokens":140688,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.34588230000000003,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":30,"outputTokens":8744,"cacheReadInputTokens":1504870,"cacheCreationInputTokens":89153,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.5283912499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["All four amendments from the final review are verified as correctly applied: (1) ADULT_FEEDING_WEIGHT consistency in add_reserve_by_feeding_units at biology.rs:510, (2) ShrimpPreset now includes Optional stage fields (presets.rs:168-184) and scenario materialization populates them via shrimp_preset_to_params (lib.rs:546-600) with legacy maturation bridge via apply_legacy_total_maturation_days, (3) v4→v5 migration derives juvenile_to_subadult_days and subadult_to_adult_days from legacy process_params.shrimp_juvenile_maturation_days (save.rs:410-436), (4) validate_shrimp_runtime_params function added (invariants.rs:256-349) and called from validate_invariants_inner (line 251).","Stage model is complete: AnimalState (biology.rs:92-144) distinguishes juvenile, sub_adult, adult StageCohorts with per-stage reserve_g, condition_index, maturation_accum; berried_females_count as adult-subset bookkeeping; molt lifecycle fields.","Lifecycle transitions are deterministic and one-way: juvenile_to_subadult (shrimp.rs:602-658) uses params.juvenile_to_subadult_days with condition gate and reserve funding; subadult_to_adult (shrimp.rs:660-717) uses params.subadult_to_adult_days with condition+molt gate; spawning (shrimp.rs:424-462) restricted to adults only; egg_development resolves cohorts to juveniles.","Feeding is stage-weighted (1.0/0.67/0.3), mortality has per-stage sensitivity (1.0x/1.2x/1.5x), reproduction restricted to adults, all stages contribute to water chemistry via total feeding_units.","Snapshot (snapshot.rs:38-42) exposes total_shrimp_count, adult_shrimp_count, sub_adult_count, juveniles_count, berried_females_count. API BiologySnapshot mirrors this. TUI displays stage breakdown.","cargo clippy --workspace: clean, no warnings. cargo fmt --all --check: clean.","cargo test --workspace: 277 passed, 1 failed. The single failure (step_hours_leaves_state_untouched_when_clamps_precede_a_validation_error in validation.rs:141) is a pre-existing regression from bead 6e5.7.1 (commit 019219e), which added refresh_habitat_registry() to Engine::from_parts(). This commit is an ancestor of e1bdd1d (the base of this bead's cycle 2 work), confirmed via git ancestry check. validation.rs was not modified by this bead."],"findings_or_gaps":["Pre-existing test failure: step_hours_leaves_state_untouched_when_clamps_precede_a_validation_error fails because bead 6e5.7.1 added refresh_habitat_registry() to Engine::from_parts() which mutates state after the test's expected snapshot is cloned. This is not a regression from 6e5.6.2.","The outstanding risk noted in the apply_fixes output about not rerunning the full scenario/e2e matrix was warranted — a broader test run would surface interactions earlier. However, the only actual failure found is from a different bead.","The 60/40 juvenile/sub-adult split from legacy total maturation days is a reasonable heuristic but could surprise presets with very different stage ratios. The code documents this clearly and any future preset can override with explicit stage durations."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["Bead 6e5.7.1 should fix the pre-existing validation test regression by either updating the test to capture expected after Engine::from_parts() or making the step_hours error path fully restore state including habitat_registry.","Consider adding a focused integration test that verifies a round-trip scenario materialize → save → load → resume preserves all stage-structured params (beyond what the existing save_load_roundtrip tests cover for the new fields specifically)."]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"b74592de-29b3-42e5-8740-40022b89a5f5"}
